  "name": "Question 6",
  "problem": "If $U={0,1,2,...,10}$ is the universal set and $X={9,10}$ then the complement of $X$ is",
  "worked_solution": "The complement of $X,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{X},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $X.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $X$ are $0,$$1,$ $2,$ $3,$ $4,$ $5,$ $6,$ $7,$ and $8.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $X$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{X}={0,1,2,...,8}.\n$$",
